    <string name="bat_title">Keep alarms reliable</string>
    <string name="bat_intro">Some manufacturers close background apps and silence their alarms. Do these steps once.</string>
    <string name="bat_generic">System settings → Battery → Toma → Unrestricted.</string>
    <string name="bat_xiaomi">Xiaomi, Redmi and POCO: Settings → Apps → Permissions → Autostart → enable Toma. Then Settings → Battery → Toma → “No restrictions”. In Recents, long-press the Toma card and tap the lock.</string>
    <string name="bat_samsung">Samsung: Settings → Battery → Background usage limits → remove Toma from “Sleeping apps”. Add it to “Never sleeping apps”.</string>
    <string name="bat_huawei">Huawei and Honor: Settings → Apps → App launch → Toma → Manage manually → enable all three options.</string>
    <string name="bat_oppo">Oppo, Realme and OnePlus: Settings → Battery → Battery optimisation → Toma → Don\'t optimise. Also enable “Allow auto-launch”.</string>
